&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Provide day to day technical support to internal customers (internal end-users)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Document, track and monitor users’ problems to ensure swift resolution through common user request management systems (Jira Ticketing, Slack, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Administration of all different platforms (Google Workspace, Slack, Jira, etc..)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Install and configure computer hardware, software, networks and applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Work with the team to create process, documentation and aim for global standardization to help streamline and speed up support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Enforce collaboration and shared practices with the rest of the I.T. team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Pro-actively monitor the status of office I.T. infrastructure, determine any issues or potential problems and recommend solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Ensure I.T. policies are adhered to at all times&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Provide orientation and guidance to users on how to operate new software and computer equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Contribute to global I.T. initiatives with professional knowledge and local insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Professional Experience/Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Proven experience in equivalent role acquired in a fast-paced and international environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Passion to deliver a world-class customer service experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experience with user support process (Jira &amp;amp; Confluence), MDM &amp;amp; Identity Provider Management (JumpCloud)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Extended experience in supporting both WinOS and MacOS computers &amp;amp; devices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strong experience of corporate networking and security practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Minimum 5 years of relevant experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Fluent in English at professional working level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Package and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great compensation package, including performance &amp;amp; company bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Health insurance for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mobile allowance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee wellbeing &amp;amp; support program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our team is global, you will work with 40+ different nationalities spread across 5 continents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sounds like you? Apply now!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
