&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our Middlesex County, New Jersey Offices are interested in a Registered Nurse who has a passion for skilled nursing! The ideal nurse has a drive for expanding their skills to join our Skilled Nursing team. We believe our clients and their families deserve the highest quality care delivered with compassion, excellence, and reliability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
